OL,3,GNEWSALeaning church gets money to fix
OL,4,Awalls and floor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lincolnshire church that tilts more
OL,7,Fthan the Leaning Tower of Pisa has
OL,8,Freceived a grant for further
OL,9,Frestoration work.
OL,11,FThe tower of St James' Church in Dry
OL,12,FDoddington leans by just over five
OL,13,Fdegrees and has been underpinned, but
OL,14,Fthe building sits on clay and the floor
OL,15,Fis rotten.
OL,17,FThe church has been awarded #128,106 by
OL,18,Fthe National Lottery Heritage Fund to
OL,19,Freplace the floor, the electrics and
OL,20,Ffix cracks in the walls.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
