OL,3,GNEWSALeaning church gets money to fix
OL,4,Awalls and floor
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarden Dick Loynes said he was
OL,7,F"absolutely over the moon" about the
OL,8,Ffunding and said that without it, the
OL,9,Fchurch would have had to close.
